  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> be a complex number such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>z</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>, then the maximum value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is",
