  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>z</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>We know that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>z</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced></mfrac></math>&nbsp;Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi></math></p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>r</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;which is&nbsp;always true.</p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>r</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo>&#8805;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>r</mi></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mi>max</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p></blockquote>",
